👑🧠 Tenali Rama and the Thieves (Raw Story)

One night, Tenali Rama heard that a group of thieves were planning to rob his house.

Tenali smiled and made a plan.

He told his wife loudly, “Let us hide all our gold in this big box and throw it into the well so no one can steal it.”

The thieves were hiding nearby and heard everything.

After Tenali went inside, the thieves came out.

They started pulling water from the well to find the box.

All night, they worked hard.

But there was no gold in the well.

In the morning, Tenali came out laughing.

“Thank you for watering my garden!” he said.

The thieves realized they had been tricked and ran away.

💖 Moral:

Intelligence can defeat even the strongest enemies.
